msgstr "[Täké ít äwäy ·····]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1011
msgid ""
"This table has merged or repeated cells, so its rows and columns are left as "
"they are."
msgstr ""
"[Thíš täblé häš mérgéd ör répéätéd céllš, šö ítš röwš äñd cölümñš äré léft "
"äš théy äré. ···································]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1014
msgid "The table could not be changed here."
msgstr "[Thé täblé cöüld ñöt bé chäñgéd héré. ···············]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1098
msgid "This item cannot move out: the item it is in goes on after its list."
msgstr ""
"[Thíš ítém cäññöt mövé öüt: thé ítém ít íš íñ göéš öñ äftér ítš líšt. "
"····························]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1165
msgid "This change cannot be accepted: it is no longer in the document."
msgstr ""
"[Thíš chäñgé cäññöt bé äccéptéd: ít íš ñö löñgér íñ thé döcüméñt. "
"··························]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1168
msgid ""
"This change cannot be rejected: its marks in the text are missing or stand "
"where its text cannot go back."
msgstr ""
"[Thíš chäñgé cäññöt bé réjéctéd: ítš märkš íñ thé téxt äré míššíñg ör štäñd "
"whéré ítš téxt cäññöt gö bäck. ···········································]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1177
msgid ""
"These columns cannot be resized: their widths are not stated, or together "
"they are under a centimetre."
msgstr ""
"[Théšé cölümñš cäññöt bé réšízéd: théír wídthš äré ñöt štätéd, ör tögéthér "
"théy äré üñdér ä céñtímétré. ·········································]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1332
msgid "This document has tracked changes."
msgstr "[Thíš döcüméñt häš träckéd chäñgéš. ··············]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1334
msgid "Edits made here are not tracked."
msgstr "[Édítš mädé héré äré ñöt träckéd. ·············]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1337
msgid "Accept all"
msgstr "[Åccépt äll ·····]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1340
msgid "Reject all"
msgstr "[Réjéct äll ·····]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1438
msgid "Select the cells to merge, from one cell of a table to another."
msgstr ""
"[Séléct thé céllš tö mérgé, fröm öñé céll öf ä täblé tö äñöthér. "
"··························]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1440
msgid "These cells cannot be merged: the table has repeated rows or cells."
msgstr ""
"[Théšé céllš cäññöt bé mérgéd: thé täblé häš répéätéd röwš ör céllš. "
"···························]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1445
msgid "The caret is not in a table cell."
msgstr "[Thé cärét íš ñöt íñ ä täblé céll. ··············]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1447
msgid "This cell cannot be split: the table has repeated rows or cells."
msgstr ""
"[Thíš céll cäññöt bé šplít: thé täblé häš répéätéd röwš ör céllš. "
"··························]"

#: crates/xodt/src/view.rs:1453
msgid "This table does not say how wide its columns are."
msgstr ""
"[Thíš täblé döéš ñöt šäy höw wídé ítš cölümñš äré. ····················]"
